	Magic Mail Pipeline (full)

	Fall Harvest (FH loop armed):
	  every 10s → claim matching mailbox from partner
	  → Magic-Mail exact selected amount (lowest tier, multi-mail, rate-limit safe)
	  → ONLY travel GV after ALL units sent successfully

	Garden Valley (pipeline armed):
	  claim Magic Mail escrow → regular-mail partner → travel FH

	Seeds: 10 / Magic Mail | Gear: 1 / Magic Mail
	Tier: lowest that can carry the item
]]

